{
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose you won't believe in",
                "what I have to say, will you?"
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's really there, in the recesses.",
                "You should see it for yourself."
            ]
        },
        "282_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A monster consumed by information!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ouch, that hurt..."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That damn Yukari!",
                "Before I could notice, she just threw me into a gap..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And she had to dump me in a dangerous place",
                "like this!"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could you be",
                "the magician from Gensokyo?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you doing",
                "in a place like this?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How do you know who I am?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am the one who knows all."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's practically nothing",
                "I don't know anymore."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "O-oh..."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So this is what Yukari wanted me to see, huh?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "When flooded with massive amounts of misinformation,",
                "a youkai's existence becomes threatened."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She said that, at the Outside World, AI is pushing that forward,",
                "and even humans are getting caught up in it."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So in other words, you're the youkai AI?"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You even know about that?"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'd expect nothing less from someone",
                "who calls herself a magician."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But you're mistaken, AI is not a youkai."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It is a prophet that tells new myths!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's that!",
                "I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way, I can't believe",
                "the truth was defeated..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What truth?",
                "You're just believing a bunch of silliness."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Silliness?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That youkai told me..."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The essence of a youkai is information."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This pyramid, where an endless stream of",
                "unverified information flows in from outside..."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is a device set up by the Lunar Capital",
                "to kill youkai."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kill... youkai!?"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You were almost dead, you know."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Waaah... The thing is, I'm just a fossilized shellfish",
                "that had been dormant here, you see..."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just recently revived,",
                "and the information here was all I had."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Please, you have to save me!"
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't know if I can save you, but..."
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Get out of here!"
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, not that I have any idea",
                "where the exit is myself..."
            ]
        }
    }
}